Modified by TOFI: the SKILL.md text was rewritten for the TOFI Bot computer
(tool names, Linux toolbox, delivery with send_message attachments). The
upstream scripts were replaced by scripts/pdf_tools.py and scripts/pdf_form.py:
form field listing and filling, and the flat-form text placement with its box
checks, follow the upstream scripts (extract_form_field_info.py,
fill_fillable_fields.py, check_bounding_boxes.py, fill_pdf_form_with_annotations.py)
with these changes: text on flat forms is drawn with reportlab instead of
FreeText annotations; labels come from pdftotext instead of pdfplumber;
page rendering uses pdftoppm instead of pdf2image; no command accepts a
password on the command line; outputs are new files and the input is never
overwritten. The long form and reference material moved to references/forms.md
and references/reference.md with the pdf-lib, pypdfium2, pdfjs, qpdf, pdftk and
pdfplumber recipes removed because those tools are not on the Bot computer.
